# Parameters on top of the SITL defaults (copter.parm, gazebo-iris.parm),
# mounted into the ardupilot container and passed as third --defaults file.
#
# GCS failsafe: RTL when no heartbeat of the GCS (SYSID_MYGCS 255, sent by
# MAVProxy over the DroneBridge link) arrived for FS_GCS_TIMEOUT (5 s,
# default). ArduCopter's default is 0 (disabled): the vehicle then kept
# flying its mission under rf_jamming. FS_OPTIONS stays at its default
# (16), i.e. no 'continue in Auto' on GCS failsafe.
FS_GCS_ENABLE 1
